ACCESS: public
TITLE: Office Timings

This document lists the regular office hours, holidays and canteen timings for all employees at the main office.

Office hours:
The office is open Monday to Friday from 9:30 AM to 6:30 PM. Employees are expected to be at their desks by 10:00 AM. The first and third Saturdays of each month are working days with half-day timings, from 9:30 AM to 1:30 PM. Sundays are closed.

Flexible timings:
Employees may request flexible hours with their manager's approval, as long as they complete 8 working hours in a day. Work from home is allowed up to 2 days a week for eligible teams.

Holidays:
The company observes 12 public holidays each year, including Republic Day, Holi, Independence Day, Gandhi Jayanti, Dussehra, Diwali and Christmas. The full holiday calendar is published on the intranet every January. If a holiday falls on a Sunday, it is not given on another day.

Canteen timings:
Breakfast is served from 8:30 AM to 10:30 AM. Lunch is served from 1:00 PM to 2:30 PM. Tea and snacks are available from 4:30 PM to 5:30 PM. The canteen is closed on Sundays and public holidays. Please return trays after eating and report any hygiene issue to the facilities team.

For any questions about timings, please contact the administration desk on the ground floor.